{
  "rationale": "First product of a fresh run: a sourced partial map of hashicorp/raft that establishes both core relationships and their connection. Formation/advancement (A1) is traced from Apply/ApplyLog through leader dispatchLogs, follower appendEntries, commitment.match/recalculate and processLogs application. Context/authority (A2) is traced through StableStore-backed term/vote persistence, the candidate election path, higher-term step-down and the leader lease. The connection is the commitment startIndex gate (a leader may only advance the commit index once a quorum has stored the first entry of its own term) together with the voter-set basis for quorum and the ErrLeadershipLost cleanup of inflight futures on step down. The core_overview is usable; the leadership-transfer handshake, the pipelined append path, user snapshot restore and startup reconstruction remain explicit open details and sourced surfaces rather than claimed coverage.",
